    "objects": {
      "general": [
        {
          "properties": {
            "paragraphs": [
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "70,022 tornadoes reported in the United States from 1950 to 2023: the date, hour, state, strength on the (Enhanced) Fujita scale, deaths, injuries, path length and width, and where each one touched down. Strength is the F scale until 2006 and the EF scale from 2007, grouped here as weak (0-1), strong (2-3) and violent (4-5); 1,024 tornadoes have no rating.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "13pt",
                      "color": "#E6EEF8"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": ""
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "How to use it",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "15pt",
                      "fontWeight": "bold",
                      "color": "#E6EEF8"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Open the Filters pane on the right (the funnel tab) to filter by category or date; the selection applies to every page. Click a bar, a slice or a point to cross-filter the other charts, and hover over one to see a small summary card.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "13pt",
                      "color": "#E6EEF8"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": ""
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Data source",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "15pt",
                      "fontWeight": "bold",
                      "color": "#E6EEF8"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "NOAA Storm Prediction Center, Severe Weather Database (1950-2023 actual tornadoes), public domain. https://www.spc.noaa.gov/wcm/#data. Prepared: state codes were spelled out, the unrated tornadoes (code -9) are a group of their own, zero coordinates were treated as missing, and the dollar-loss columns were left out because their units changed over the years. Counts before the 1970s are lower because weak tornadoes were less often reported.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "13pt",
                      "color": "#E6EEF8"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": ""
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Measures",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "15pt",
                      "fontWeight": "bold",
                      "color": "#E6EEF8"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Tornadoes = COUNTROWS(USTornadoes)",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "13pt",
                      "color": "#E6EEF8"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Deaths = SUM(USTornadoes[Fatalities])",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "13pt",
                      "color": "#E6EEF8"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Total injuries = SUM(USTornadoes[Injuries])",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "13pt",
                      "color": "#E6EEF8"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Average path length (mi) = AVERAGE(USTornadoes[Length_miles])",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "13pt",
                      "color": "#E6EEF8"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Violent tornadoes (EF4-5) = CALCULATE(COUNTROWS(USTornadoes), USTornadoes[Strength] = \"3 Violent (EF4-5)\")",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "13pt",
                      "color": "#E6EEF8"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Deadly tornado share = DIVIDE(CALCULATE(COUNTROWS(USTornadoes), USTornadoes[Fatalities] > 0), COUNTROWS(USTornadoes))",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "13pt",
                      "color": "#E6EEF8"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Average path width (yd) = AVERAGE(USTornadoes[Width_yards])",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "13pt",
                      "color": "#E6EEF8"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "State tile = SELECTEDVALUE(USTornadoes[State_code])",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "13pt",
                      "color": "#E6EEF8"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
